//api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/java-archive","state":"uploaded","size":5721984,"digest":"sha256:aa8b0687c64079d54498b74788e8fa467f26fb0a32e979e32c16c41d29c082dd","download_count":24,"created_at":"2026-03-05T06:25:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T06:25:13Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/download/v1.1.1/Toolscreen-1.1.1-double-click-me.jar"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/tarball/v1.1.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/zipball/v1.1.1","body":"Setup video: https://youtu.be/YqS-fxPx_jo\r\nPatreon: https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n- **Added support for windowed mode**\r\n- **Added keyboard layout and advanced rebinding options**\r\n- **Added a hotkey to toggle whether key rebinding is enabled**\r\n- **Added auto-borderless mode (fe-art)**\r\n- Added more size & position customization for EyeZoom overlay\r\n- Added the ability to double click sliders to set a more precise value (previously it was only ctrl+click)\r\n- Added the ability to select a custom image for the EyeZoom overlay\r\n- Added ability to configure which mode is the default (fe-art)\r\n- Added a Supporters tab for the Patreon\r\n- Added an API for other programs to communicate with Toolscreen\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed hotkeys not working with rebinds (fe-art)\r\n- Fixed multiple color keys not working for image & window overlays (fe-art)\r\n- Fixed rebinding modifier keys not working\r\n- Fixed EyeZoom rendering issues with fog (low render distance, pause menu, or underwater)\r\n- Fixed a bug with default GUI hotkey being incorrect under rare circumstances\r\n- Fixed the EyeZoom overlay not centering properly with resolutions other than 384 width\r\n- Fixed the hotkeys for toggling overlay visibility not working while in config GUI\r\n- Fixed a softlock when binding something to left click\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- Prevent setting duplicate hotkeys (fe-art)\r\n- Changed hook chaining to enabled by default to support third-party overlays\r\n- Added a note that Raw Input be enabled for sensitivity changes\r\n\r\nHow to update: If you're on 1.0.6 or higher, just launch your instance and it will prompt you to update\r\nOtherwise, download either the .exe or the .jar below, put it in the instance folder, and double click it\r\n# Patreon\r\nIf you would like to support the future development of Toolscreen, you can now [subscribe through Patreon](<https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777>), your name will show up in the Supporters tab of Toolscreen and you get access to a supporter discord channel"}